---
/**
 * Landing illustration: transfer pricing in one glance. Two related companies
 * on either side of a national border, goods one way, payment the other, and
 * the internal "? price" that decides where profit lands. Representative art,
 * not a chart from any lesson. Token-driven so it matches the light system.
 */
---

<div class="not-prose rounded-lg bg-surface-soft p-7 sm:p-8">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 400 300"
    class="mx-auto block h-auto w-full max-w-[420px]"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Two companies in the same group pricing a sale to each other across a national border"
  >
    <line x1="200" y1="14" x2="200" y2="286" stroke="var(--color-hairline-strong)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 6" />
    <text x="98" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-stone)">Country A</text>
    <text x="302" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--color-stone)">Country B</text>

    <rect x="150" y="44" width="100" height="34" rx="10" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
    <text x="200" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-on-dark)">Parent group</text>
    <path d="M200 78 V96 M120 96 H280 M120 96 V120 M280 96 V120" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-hairline-strong)" stroke-width="1.5" />

    <rect x="66" y="120" width="108" height="96" rx="14" fill="var(--color-canvas)" stroke="var(--color-hairline)" />
    <rect x="86" y="140" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="112" y="140" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="138" y="140" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" />
    <rect x="86" y="164" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="112" y="164" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="138" y="164" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" />
    <text x="120" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-ink)">Company A</text>

    <rect x="226" y="120" width="108" height="96" rx="14" fill="var(--color-canvas)" stroke="var(--color-hairline)" />
    <rect x="246" y="140" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="272" y="140" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="298" y="140" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" />
    <rect x="246" y="164" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="272" y="164" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" /><rect x="298" y="164" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="var(--color-surface-soft)" />
    <text x="280" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="var(--color-ink)">Company B</text>

    <path d="M176 244 H222" stroke="var(--color-stone)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#pc-ar)" />
    <path d="M224 268 H178" stroke="var(--color-stone)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#pc-ar)" />
    <text x="150" y="240" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-mute)">goods</text>
    <text x="252" y="281" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-mute)">payment</text>

    <rect x="168" y="120" width="64" height="34" rx="10" fill="var(--color-primary)" />
    <text x="200" y="142" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="800" fill="var(--color-on-primary)">? price</text>

    <defs>
      <marker id="pc-ar" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="5" refY="3.5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0 0 L6 3.5 L0 7 z" fill="var(--color-stone)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <p class="mt-4 text-center text-sm text-mute">
    Set that price wrong, and profit shifts to the wrong country. Setting it right is the job.
  </p>
</div>
